{# ── Chapter: Takeaway ── #}
<section class="case-chapter" data-chapter="takeaway">
  <h2>Remember</h2>
  <div class="case-takeaway">
    <h3>Key takeaways</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="tone-junior">Without a sideEffects field, bundlers assume the safest option — keep everything — which means one small import can pull in a whole library.</div>
        <div class="tone-mid">"sideEffects": false in package.json tells the bundler it's safe to remove any export the app doesn't actually use.</div>
        <div class="tone-staff">List real side-effectful files explicitly rather than marking a whole package false, and verify the reduction actually happened with a bundle analyzer, not just the config.</div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
